{"at":"2026-11-21T00:52:00.930Z","account":"music-tools-x","platform":"x","status":"published","source":"manual","slotId":"music-tools-x:workflow:44846586940","text":"録音中の一瞬を、動き続ける素材に変えたい人へ。SoundGhost Fragmentは音声を一時保持し、最大4つの断片を別々の速さ・音程・位置で循環。サンプルも読み込めます。ループ素材を細かく組み替えたい人向け。単純な録音保存だけなら、別の道具で足りるかも。","mediaUrl":"https://soundghost.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Fragment_SQ_1.jpg","mediaType":"image","mediaAltText":null,"mediaQa":null,"mediaResolution":null,"commercial":{"kind":"organic","paidPartnership":false},"providerPostId":"2123942471197749306","ai":null,"features":null,"rationale":null,"predictedScore":null,"selectionMode":null,"experiment":null,"sources":[],"textHash":"8ecb15f73a23044d0ea6"}
