{"at":"2026-11-22T00:21:44.946Z","account":"music-tools-x","platform":"x","status":"published","source":"manual","slotId":"music-tools-x:workflow:44966223084","text":"録った生ドラムのノリを残して、音だけ差し替えたい人へ。Prism: Drumsは演奏を9種類のドラム音に分け、タイミングや強弱をMIDI化。別キットで試したい人向けです。アコースティック録音向けなので、電子ドラム中心なら試用で確認を。","mediaUrl":"https://aurallysound.com/cdn/shop/files/Screenshot_1.png?v=1791570525&width=1200","mediaType":"image","mediaAltText":null,"mediaQa":null,"mediaResolution":null,"commercial":{"kind":"organic","paidPartnership":false},"providerPostId":"2124297241993289987","ai":null,"features":null,"rationale":null,"predictedScore":null,"selectionMode":null,"experiment":null,"sources":[],"textHash":"6e9bd27bf60c0700fd86"}
{"at":"2026-11-22T11:38:57.742Z","account":"music-tools-x","platform":"x","status":"published","source":"manual","slotId":"music-tools-x:workflow:45018334777","text":"決まったドラムループではなく、鳴るたびに変化するパーカッションを探す人へ。Envoyは600種のアナログ音源を再構成しながら鳴らすKontakt音源。リズムの揺れを作りたい人向けです。自分のサンプルは読み込めないので、手持ち素材を使いたい人は見送りでも。","mediaUrl":"https://emergenceaudio.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1x1-cover-copy-scaled.jpg","mediaType":"image","mediaAltText":null,"mediaQa":null,"mediaResolution":null,"commercial":{"kind":"organic","paidPartnership":false},"providerPostId":"2124467667490968002","ai":null,"features":null,"rationale":null,"predictedScore":null,"selectionMode":null,"experiment":null,"sources":[],"textHash":"5c55aab1ed9bb176c4aa"}
