{"at":"2026-11-24T11:19:23.808Z","account":"music-tools-x","platform":"x","status":"published","source":"manual","slotId":"music-tools-x:workflow:45383078940","text":"EQのカットを、曲のコードやキックに追従させる。無料のAURORA 1.7は、音程や音源を基準に動くEQバンドを作れます。固定の周波数で十分なら、急いで追加しなくても。","mediaUrl":"https://13x.audio/shots/aurora-1.5-og.jpg","mediaType":"image","mediaAltText":null,"mediaQa":null,"mediaResolution":null,"commercial":{"kind":"organic","paidPartnership":false},"providerPostId":"2125187520094720234","ai":null,"features":null,"rationale":null,"predictedScore":null,"selectionMode":null,"experiment":null,"sources":[],"textHash":"bbc758e5795a667eb11e"}
{"at":"2026-11-25T00:31:26.284Z","account":"music-tools-x","platform":"x","status":"published","source":"manual","slotId":"music-tools-x:workflow:45518698099","text":"「OTT系の圧縮を、まず無料で試したい」人にMinimal AudioのSquash。音を押しつぶすような強い圧縮を手早く加えるツールです。細かなダイナミクス調整や自然な整音が目的なら、手持ちのコンプで足りるかも。","mediaUrl":"https://www.minimal.audio/vite/assets/squash-DBIlf-3l.webp","mediaType":"image","mediaAltText":null,"mediaQa":null,"mediaResolution":null,"commercial":{"kind":"organic","paidPartnership":false},"providerPostId":"2125386844099481741","ai":null,"features":null,"rationale":null,"predictedScore":null,"selectionMode":null,"experiment":null,"sources":[],"textHash":"a3f95f2746b37de197a8"}
{"at":"2026-11-25T11:29:53.298Z","account":"music-tools-x","platform":"x","status":"published","source":"manual","slotId":"music-tools-x:workflow:45604928272","text":"1985年のハイブリッドシンセを、現代の制作環境へ。Cherry Audio「DW-8K」はKorg DW-8000を再構築し、2レイヤーやMPEにも対応。あの時代のデジタル波形が欲しい人向け。すでに似た音源が揃っているなら、まずデモで違いを確認したい。","mediaUrl":"https://cherryaudio.com/img/asset/YXNzZXRzL3Byb2R1Y3RzL25hdi9kdy04ay1pbWctbmF2LmpwZw/dw-8k-img-nav.jpg?p=seo_pro_og&s=bb05fd620c996e535ee7b6cc88670457","mediaType":"image","mediaAltText":null,"mediaQa":null,"mediaResolution":null,"commercial":{"kind":"organic","paidPartnership":false},"providerPostId":"2125552548501209337","ai":null,"features":null,"rationale":null,"predictedScore":null,"selectionMode":null,"experiment":null,"sources":[],"textHash":"51743b34d745d4df7f02"}
{"at":"2026-11-26T00:18:48.958Z","account":"music-tools-x","platform":"x","status":"published","source":"manual","slotId":"music-tools-x:workflow:45727806923","text":"ボーカルの「最後の一語だけ」にディレイをかけたい人へ。iZotope Nectar 5のMomentsは、歌詞から言葉を選んでエフェクトを適用。手描きオートメーションを減らせる一方、MomentsはARA対応DAWが必要。Ableton LiveやFL Studio中心なら、この機能目当ての導入は慎重に。","mediaUrl":"https://izotope.com/cdn/shop/files/48a9be81-2d61-48ba-aa1a-4a2e9cb52cfe.png?v=1795190026&width=1400","mediaType":"image","mediaAltText":null,"mediaQa":null,"mediaResolution":null,"commercial":{"kind":"organic","paidPartnership":false},"providerPostId":"2125746055446929842","ai":null,"features":null,"rationale":null,"predictedScore":null,"selectionMode":null,"experiment":null,"sources":[],"textHash":"e14a8f956f2e19602269"}
{"at":"2026-11-26T11:17:21.847Z","account":"music-tools-x","platform":"x","status":"published","source":"manual","slotId":"music-tools-x:workflow:45809184862","text":"録音素材を、サンプル再生ではなく「弾ける音源」にしたい人へ。Krate AudioのInnexusは音声を最大96の倍音に分解し、演奏できる音色として再合成。素材の質感を鍵盤で展開する発想が面白い。普通のサンプラーで足りるなら見送りでも。","mediaUrl":"https://krateaudio.com/innexus/images/hero.png","mediaType":"image","mediaAltText":null,"mediaQa":null,"mediaResolution":null,"commercial":{"kind":"organic","paidPartnership":false},"providerPostId":"2125911783424864559","ai":null,"features":null,"rationale":null,"predictedScore":null,"selectionMode":null,"experiment":null,"sources":[],"textHash":"a0521b8e4ecbebbca61e"}
{"at":"2026-11-27T00:34:03.347Z","account":"music-tools-x","platform":"x","status":"published","source":"manual","slotId":"music-tools-x:workflow:45917445566","text":"カメラの前で手を動かして、左右別々の音を演奏する。Suzan Studioは物理モデリングや微分音階も備えたブラウザ音源です。DAW用シンセの置き換えというより、思いつきを試すスケッチ場として面白い。","mediaUrl":"https://suzanstudio.com/audio-showcase/unit_06_gesture.jpg","mediaType":"image","mediaAltText":null,"mediaQa":null,"mediaResolution":null,"commercial":{"kind":"organic","paidPartnership":false},"providerPostId":"2126112278739296555","ai":null,"features":null,"rationale":null,"predictedScore":null,"selectionMode":null,"experiment":null,"sources":[],"textHash":"4dde16465be09fd958c7"}
